OL,3,AMP calls for action after her likeness 
OL,4,Aused for AI porn deepfakes             
OL,6,FA member of parliament whose name and  
OL,7,Fimage were used in AI content on porn  
OL,8,Fsites said the issue could make women  
OL,9,Fless likely to want to enter public    
OL,10,Flife.                                  
OL,12,FMims Davies, the shadow Welsh          
OL,13,FSecretary, said she received an email  
OL,14,Fin her parliamentary inbox which said  
OL,15,F"her likeness was found on forums in   
OL,16,Fabusive and pornographic content".     
OL,18,FThe Conservative frontbencher said     
OL,19,Fpeople making money from deepfakes was 
OL,20,F"grotesque", urging people to report it
OL,21,Fif it happens to them so that "culprits
OL,22,Fcan be held to account".               
